# Unreleased
- [fix][minor] Fix SHA256 checksums to be lowercase.

# Version 0.2.6 - 2026-04-30
- [fix][minor] Update dependencies.

# Version 0.2.5 - 2026-01-22
- [change][minor] Update dependencies.
- [add][minor] Add `registry.api_url()` and `registry.download_url()`.
- [add][minor] Print config snippet for Cargo when initializing a new registry.

# Version 0.2.4 - 2021-11-30
- [fix][minor] Fix adding files to the index of the index repository.

# Version 0.2.3 - 2021-10-05
- [fix][minor] Fix deserialization of search queries with escaped characters.

# Version 0.2.2 - 2021-10-03
- [add][minor] Automatically reload TLS keys and certificates every 24 hours.

# Version 0.2.1 - 2021-09-12
- [add][minor] Add method and CLI command to completely delete a crate.

# Version 0.2.0 - 2021-09-02
- [add][patch] Add README.
- [add][minor] Implement `search` API endpoint.
- [add][minor] Add more logging to the server application and improve logging format.
- [add][minor] Create new registries with user provided URL in the CLI tool.

# Version 0.1.3 - 2021-08-30
- [change][minor] Use lower case `palletizer.toml` as configuration file.
- [fix][minor] Fix format of dependencies in index entries.

# Version 0.1.2 - 2021-08-29
- [add][minor] Limit dependencies to registries allowed in the configuration file.

# Version 0.1.1 - 2021-08-28
- [fix][minor] * Fix index path for 1, 2 and 3 letter crates.
- [fix][minor] * Fix the name of the `version_req` field in index entries.

# Version 0.1.0 - 2021-05-17
- [add][minor] Support adding, yanking and unyanking crates.
- [add][minor] Serve the index and registry API on a webserver.
